\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The same WebTraffic{} series through both models --- \emph  {top:} the MILLET{} baseline (423{,}707 parameters), \emph  {bottom:} ours (41{,}324). Left, the predicted class distribution with the true class marked; right, the series coloured by each model's own interpretation (red supports the predicted class, blue argues against), with the shaded band showing where the generator put the class signal. The smaller model is both more confident and more selective. Panel-title accuracy and AOPCR are dataset means over three seeds; the single series shown is illustrative, not evidence.}}{3}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
